{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118634","id":3538290451,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7S5gcT","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118634","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118634/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118634/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118634/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/96a57910cb21cd84ba012b017586f2be2d71e130","number":118634,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add ability to drag-toggle visibility in scene tree editor","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Resolves godotengine/godot-proposals#5488.\r\nSupersedes #102009.\r\n\r\nThis adds the ability to drag-toggle the visibility of nodes in the scene node editor, where the toggled state of the first node is applied to any subsequent node whose visibility button you drag across.\r\n\r\nUnlike #102009 this involves no `Tree` changes (which seemed to be a point of contention there) and is instead contained almost entirely within the `gui_input` handler of `SceneTreeEditor`.\r\n\r\n[visibility-dragging.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ccb1a4f-3807-4b48-b7aa-da3cb63eb028)\r\n\r\nA couple of noteworthy quirks:\r\n\r\n1. The undo action is created when you release the mouse button, meaning after we've already changed the visibility states. There may potentially be some edge-cases where we never actually put the changes on the undo stack.\r\n2. Since we don't suppress the `Tree` button handling when starting the drag operation, the visibility button you start from will be in a pressed state for the duration of the drag.\r\n\r\n---\r\n_Disclaimer: AI tooling was used to review this change, which prompted a few minor changes, all of which have been carefully reviewed to the best of my ability._","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milesto